    "group": "Wrath of the Doomed",
    "summary": "For friendly DEATH COMPANY units, the **[assault doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)** becomes active for them at the start of every phase, and the devastator or tactical doctrine can never be active; so, whatever other rules say, a DEATH COMPANY unit never has any active doctrine except the assault doctrine. Restrictions: BLOOD ANGELS units are allowed in your army, but ADEPTUS ASTARTES units from any other Chapter are not.",
